# Defense-in-depth: the Bridge 1-0 spike (see run_spike.sh / spike_compose.yml)
# generates a throwaway CA + server/client certs under pki/ at runtime. That
# material must never be committed, even accidentally -- it's destroyed by
# Step 6 of the spike's own cleanup, but this backstops `git add .` mistakes.
pki/
*.crt
*.key
*.csr
*.srl
